<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.5 bln 7-day bill yields avg 2.926 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.5 bln 7-day bill yields avg 2.926 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said on Wednesday its C$1.5 billion auction of 7-day T-bills due December 5 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD</p>
<p>			  AVG   2.926  PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    2.850  HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    2.980  66.66667</p>
<p>The bills will be dated and issued on November 28.</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada said it bought none of the new issue.</p>
<p>- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
